# preventDefault

When `preventDefault` is ticked:

-   Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** show Highlight.
-   Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** show Tooltip.
-   Legend Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** update Highlight.
-   Series Area/Legend Keyboard interactions **MUST** show Focus Indicator.
-   Legend Mouse/Keyboard click **MUST** update Series Visibility.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Prevent Default Test"
    name="map-prevent-default"
    type="generated"
/%}

# AG-16841

## Click-To-Freeze

`seriesNodeClick` should still fire on frozen charts.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Click To Freeze"
    name="click-to-freeze"
    type="generated"
/%}

## Candlestick Crosshairs

When clicking a candlestick

-   An "Unfreeze" button **MUST** be shown in the tooltip
-   Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** update Highlight.
-   Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** update Tooltip.
-   Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** update the X-Crosshair.
-   Series Area Mouse-Move interactions **MUST** update the Y-Crosshair.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Candlestick Crosshairs"
    name="candlestick-crosshairs"
    type="generated"
/%}

## Updating Data

Check that `frozen` and `dataIdKey` work properly together:

-   Click a bar: it **MUST** activate & freeze.
-   Click "Add Start" button: same bar **MUST** be activated.
-   Click "Remove Start" button: same bar **MUST** be activated.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Updating Data"
    name="data-mutation"
    type="generated"
/%}

## Frozen Survives ZoomPan

Check that `frozen` survives zoom/panning changes:

-   Click "Freeze on April":
    -   That marker **MUST** freeze and activate.
-   Update the ZoomPan such that the April marker moves:
    -   The highlight/tooltip **MUST** update to reflect the marker's new position.
-   Update the ZoomPan such that the April marker is no longer in the viewport:
    -   The higlight/tooltip/crosshair **MUST** be hidden.
-   Update the ZoomPan such that the April marker return into the viewport:
    -   The higlight/tooltip/crosshair **MUST** be restored.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Frozen Survives ZoomPan"
    name="frozen-zoompan"
    type="generated"
/%}

# External Legend

-   The external legend should behave just like our internal legend.
-   The external legend is implemented using `setState({active})`.
-   Our internal legend is disabled (`legend.enabled: false`); this **MUST NOT**
    affect the external legend.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="External Legends"
    name="legend-disabled"
    type="generated"
/%}
